{'symbol': 'IQV', 'date': '2022-06-07 08:00:00', 'title': 'IQVIA APPOINTS DR. CHRISTINA MACK CHIEF SCIENTIFIC OFFICER OF REAL WORLD SOLUTIONS', 'text': "RESEARCH TRIANGLE PARK, N.C.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--IQVIA (NYSE:IQV), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF ADVANCED ANALYTICS, TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS AND CONTRACT SERVICES TO THE LIFE SCIENCES INDUSTRY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF DR. CHRISTINA MACK TO SERVE AS CHIEF SCIENTIFIC OFFICER FOR THE COMPANY'S REAL WORLD SOLUTIONS (RWS) BUSINESS, EFFECTIVE JULY 7, 2022. CHRISTINA IS SUCCEEDING DR. NANCY DREYER, WHO IS RETIRING AFTER NEARLY TWO DECADES WITH IQVIA. IN THIS NEW ROLE, DR. MACK WILL BE RESPONSIBLE"}